    "</td> <td>    <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://github.com/google-gemini/gemma-cookbook/blob/main/docs/recurrentgemma/recurrentgemma_jax_inference.ipynb\"><img src=\"https://www.tensorflow.org/images/GitHub-Mark-32px.png\" />View source on GitHub</a>\n",
